From: Yaw diagnostic field session (issue #13)
Subject: [Fix 4] xsens.yaml — switch filter profile to GeneralNoBaro_RTK

Effect: changes Xsens MTi-680G filter profile from default 0
(General_RTK, implicit) to index 1 (GeneralNoBaro_RTK). Disables
barometer fusion in the IMU's onboard filter; magnetometer stays
active. Movella recommends this profile when barometric altitude is
noisy or unreliable.

Param names verified against driver source:
  src/xsens_mti/src/xsens_mti_ros2_driver/src/xdainterface.cpp:1455-1458
  src/xsens_mti/src/xsens_mti_ros2_driver/param/xsens_mti_node.yaml:73,83

NOTE: Issue #13 / `feedback_xsens_imu_bias_recovery` refer to the
profile as "General_NoBaro" — the actual driver string is
`GeneralNoBaro_RTK`. Same thing.

ONLY apply if Test A + Test B together show the IMU has a motion-time
yaw bias that wheel-derived yaw does NOT exhibit. If wheels are the
biased source instead, do NOT apply this — apply Fix 1 + Fix 2.

Apply with:    git apply docs/yaw_diag_patches/fix4_xsens_general_nobaro.patch
Revert with:   git apply -R docs/yaw_diag_patches/fix4_xsens_general_nobaro.patch

After applying, run a TWO-STEP relaunch sequence:
  1. Relaunch sensors.launch.py with enable_filter_config: true.
     Driver writes the new profile to device flash. Verify in logs:
       "Filter profile set to GeneralNoBaro_RTK"
  2. Manually edit xsens.yaml to set enable_filter_config: false
     (prevents re-flashing on every boot). Relaunch again.

NO USB power cycle needed — profile persists in device flash.

---
diff --git a/src/avros_bringup/config/xsens.yaml b/src/avros_bringup/config/xsens.yaml
--- a/src/avros_bringup/config/xsens.yaml
+++ b/src/avros_bringup/config/xsens.yaml
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@ xsens_mti_node:
     # Output rate
     enable_deviceConfig: false     # Set true ONCE to flash config, then false
     output_data_rate: 100          # Hz
+
+    # Filter profile (issue #13) — switch from default General_RTK to
+    # GeneralNoBaro_RTK to drop barometric fusion when motion-time IMU
+    # bias is suspected. 0=General_RTK, 1=GeneralNoBaro_RTK, 2=GeneralMag_RTK
+    enable_filter_config: true     # IMPORTANT: set back to false after first flash
+    mti_filter_option: 1

     # Publishers
     publisher_queue_size: 5
